{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burger Rush Simulator is a relaxing first-person simulation where you manage every aspect of your fast food restaurant. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddfe<strong>TAKE ORDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handle cash or credit card payments at the checkout, or hire a cashier to manage it for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/Checkout.gif?t=1746476190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude97<strong>DRIVE THRU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boost your sales by unlocking the drive-thru and upgrading your restaurant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/DriveThru.gif?t=1746476190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce6<strong>RESTOCK CONTAINERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the in-game computer to order supplies and restock food containers and kitchen equipment as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/Restock.gif?t=1746476190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf5f<strong>PREPARE ORDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare burgers, fries, ice cream, coffee, and drinks to serve your customers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621510/extras/BurgerMaking.gif?t=1746476190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong>DESIGN AND IMPROVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place tables and kitchen equipment, improve both capacity and capability, grow your business, and serve more customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\